  "how": "tools is JSON text. Parse it and compute the contract digest (SPEC.md sections 4 to 7) and the extras digest (section 8). Each of contract and extras is {digest, hex, canonical}, where digest is the SRI form, hex the same hash as sha256:<hex> and canonical the text that is hashed; or {error} with the code of section 10 (where several codes apply, the one section 10 says to report); extras is {digest: null} when no tool carries a member outside the contract. equal and differ name pairs of vectors whose digests of the named kind must match or must not.",
